WEBVTT

00:00:09,330 --> 00:00:12,610
I just started reading how to start with your cancer by Jane McClelland.

00:00:12,610 --> 00:00:13,890
Are you familiar with this book?

00:00:13,890 --> 00:00:14,690
What do you think of it?

00:00:14,690 --> 00:00:19,890
So this is using what has come to be come to notice caroncology approach,

00:00:19,890 --> 00:00:24,290
which is using different medication to help with,

00:00:24,290 --> 00:00:27,890
to help block the metabolic pathways of the cancer.

00:00:27,890 --> 00:00:33,250
You see Docs of Cyclein and Metformid and things like that.

00:00:33,250 --> 00:00:35,170
They can have, they can have benefits.

00:00:35,170 --> 00:00:39,090
We have some people that may be on this call that are doing some of those things.

00:00:40,290 --> 00:00:44,450
The negative is that they're drugs and they have side effects too.

00:00:44,450 --> 00:00:49,330
So you have to weigh that out and feel what you're comfortable with.

